omx-plugins (0.13.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * ci: the RPM job gets 60 minutes as selftest does; the wave's plugins
    outgrew 30 (#212)
  * ci: make selftest gets 60 minutes; the port-hint arms of the wave outgrew
    30 (#212)
  * docs: the stood break names its fact and cites no private issue (#210)
  * omx-plugins 0.13.0: omx-contract >= 3.0.0, plugin-hostd-devel >= 0.7.0,
    omx-clap-core-devel >= 0.13.0 (#210)
  * make round-trip: author, generate both faces, scan them back through
    plugin-hostd, compare; face-descriptor retires (#210)
  * descriptors: the CLAP features in the bag by their macro names, and needs
    lv2:hardRTCapable (#210)
  * docs: the CLAP features in the bag by their macro names, and the faces'
    needs (#210)
  * docs: the round trip replaces the check of our own faces (#210)
  * generators: the LV2 units and designations and the CLAP modules from
    plugin-hostd's format tables read backwards (#210)
  * docs: the faces are written from plugin-hostd's format tables read
    backwards (#210)
  * descriptors: an integer travel's scale is stepped, as both faces and the
    parameter contract state it (#210)
  * descriptors: the extension bag, plugin.doc and the ratio unit; the extras
    files drop what the descriptor says (#210)
  * docs: the descriptor carries the extension bag, plugin.doc and the ratio
    unit; the extras file keeps only the extras (#210)
  * contract.d/3: the descriptors install under schema major 3, their $schema
    the v3 URL (#210)
  * omx-contract.mjs: the EQ default probe reads omx_eq_defaults.h from
    omx-dsp 0.25.0 on, omxdsp_definitions.h before (#210)

